PPTDAC REM 0947 04050                                                   TDAC0001
* TDAC --- TAPE DUPLICATE AND COMPARE ROUTINE                           TDAC0002
* APRIL 5, 1960 --- JIM J. JONES                                        TDAC0003
*   P U R P O S E .                                                     TDAC0004
*     1. TO MOVE RECORDS AND/OR FILES OF BINARY AND/OR BCD              TDAC0005
*        INFORMATION FROM ANY TAPE OR TAPES ON CHANNEL A TO             TDAC0006
*        ANY TAPE OR TAPES ON CHANNEL B.                                TDAC0007
*     2. TO COMPARE ANY NUMBER OF RECORDS AND/OR FILES OF               TDAC0008
*        BINARY AND/OR BCD INFORMATION FROM ANY TAPE OR TAPES           TDAC0009
*        ON CHANNEL A WITH A TAPE OR TAPES ON CHANNEL B.                TDAC0010
*                                                                       TDAC0011
*   U S A G E .                                                         TDAC0012
*     COMMUNICATION WITH THE ROUTINE MAY BE THROUGH TWO MEDIA,          TDAC0013
*     CONTROL CARDS FROM THE ON-LINE CARD READER, AND INPUT             TDAC0014
*     SWITCH SETTINGS FROM THE CONSOLE.                                 TDAC0015
*     1. CONTROL CARDS                                                  TDAC0016
*          MODE   (XXX)   DEFINES TAPE MODE. (XXX)= BIN OR BCD          TDAC0017
*          ATAP   N       DEFINES CHANNEL A TAPE AS UNIT N              TDAC0018
*          BTAP   N       DEFINES CHANNEL B TAPE AS UNIT N              TDAC0019
*          DUPR   N       DUPLICATE N RECORDS                           TDAC0020
*          DUPF   N       DUPLICATE N FILES                             TDAC0021
*          COMR   N       COMPARE N RECORDS                             TDAC0022
*          COMF   N       COMPARE N FILES                               TDAC0023
*          SKRA   N       SKIP N RECORDS ON CHANNEL A TAPE              TDAC0024
*          SKRB   N       SKIP N RECORDS ON CHANNEL B TAPE              TDAC0025
*          SKFA   N       SKIP N FILES ON CHANNEL A TAPE                TDAC0026
*          SKFB   N       SKIP N FILES ON CHANNEL B TAPE                TDAC0027
*          BSRA   N       BACKSPACE TAPE A N RECORDS                    TDAC0028
*          BSRB   N       BACKSPACE TAPE B N RECORDS                    TDAC0029
*          BSFA   N       BACKSPACE TAPE A N FILES                      TDAC0030
*          BSFB   N       BACKSPACE TAPE B N FILES                      TDAC0031
*          WEFB           WRITE AN END OF FILE ON TAPE B                TDAC0032
*          REWA           REWIND TAPE A                                 TDAC0033
*          REWB           REWIND TAPE B                                 TDAC0034
*          PAUSE          STOP OPERATION                                TDAC0035
*          MESAGE         PRINT COLUMNS 16-72 OF THIS CARD              TDAC0036
*          (BLANK)        TRANSFER CONTROL TO CONSOLE                   TDAC0037
       EJECT                                                            TDAC0038
       SPACE                                                            TDAC0039
*   U S A G E . (CONT.)                                                 TDAC0040
*     2. CONSOLE INPUT SWITCH SETTINGS.                                 TDAC0041
*        S,1-5  CHANNEL A TAPE NUMBER                                   TDAC0042
*        6-11   CHANNEL B TAPE NUMBER                                   TDAC0043
*        12-17  OPERATION CODE (SEE BELOW)                              TDAC0044
*        18-20  TAPE MODE, 1=BCD   2=BINARY                             TDAC0045
*        21-35  COUNT FOR COMMANDS THAT REQUIRE ONE                     TDAC0046
*                                                                       TDAC0047
*       OPERATION CODES (SWITCHES 12-17)                                TDAC0048
*        00 - REVERT CONTROL TO CARD READER                             TDAC0049
*        01 - SAME AS DUPR                                              TDAC0050
*        02 - SAME AS DUPF                                              TDAC0051
*        03 - SAME AS COMR                                              TDAC0052
*        04 - SAME AS COMF                                              TDAC0053
*        05 - SAME AS SKRA                                              TDAC0054
*        06 - SAME AS SKRB                                              TDAC0055
*        07 - SAME AS SKFA                                              TDAC0056
*        10 - SAME AS SKFB                                              TDAC0057
*        11 - SAME AS BSRA                                              TDAC0058
*        12 - SAME AS BSRB                                              TDAC0059
*        13 - SAME AS BSFA                                              TDAC0060
*        14 - SAME AS BSFB                                              TDAC0061
*        15 - SAME AS WEFB                                              TDAC0062
*        16 - SAME AS REWA                                              TDAC0063
*        17 - SAME AS REWB                                              TDAC0064
       EJECT                                                            TDAC0065
       ORG     64                                                       TDAC0066
 START TSX     IOFF,4            TURN OFF TAPE INDICATORS.              TDAC0067
       SPACE   1                                                        TDAC0068
       RCDA                      READ A CONTROL CARD.                   TDAC0069
       RCHA    CW1               IOCD I,,24                             TDAC0070
       TCOA    *                                                        TDAC0071
       TEFA    BLANK             IF EOF CHANGE CONTROL TO CONSOLE.      TDAC0072
       TSX     HCBCD,4           CONVERT CARD IMAGE TO BCD.             TDAC0073
       PZE     I,,B                                                     TDAC0074
       SPACE   1                                                        TDAC0075
       CAL     B+1                                                      TDAC0076
       LAS     MES               IS THIS A MESSAGE CARD.                TDAC0077
       TRA     *+2                                                      TDAC0078
       TRA     ST1               GO TO PRINT MESSAGE.                   TDAC0079
       SPACE   1                                                        TDAC0080
       TSX     PLINE,4           PRINT CONTROL CARD ON-LINE.            TDAC0081
       PZE     B,,12                                                    TDAC0082
       CAL     B+1                                                      TDAC0083
       AXT     20,1                                                     TDAC0084
       LAS     TB1+20,1                                                 TDAC0085
       TRA     *+2                                                      TDAC0086
       TRA     ST2                                                      TDAC0087
       TIX     *-3,1,1                                                  TDAC0088
       TSX     PLINE,4                                                  TDAC0089
       PZE     MS1,,6                                                   TDAC0090
       TRA     PAUSE                                                    TDAC0091
       SPACE   1                                                        TDAC0092
 ST1   LDI     B+2                                                      TDAC0093
       RIL     770000                                                   TDAC0094
       SIL     600000                                                   TDAC0095
       STI     B+2                                                      TDAC0096
       TSX     PLINE,4                                                  TDAC0097
       PZE     B+2,,10                                                  TDAC0098
       TRA     START                                                    TDAC0099
       SPACE   1                                                        TDAC0100
 ST2   CLA     TTB1+20,1                                                TDAC0101
       TPL*    TTB1+20,1                                                TDAC0102
       TSX     NCVT,4                                                   TDAC0103
       TRA*    TTB1+20,1                                                TDAC0104
       SPACE   1                                                        TDAC0105
 TTB1  PZE     MODE                                                     TDAC0106
       MZE     ATAP                                                     TDAC0107
       MZE     BTAP                                                     TDAC0108
       MZE     DUPR                                                     TDAC0109
       MZE     DUPF                                                     TDAC0110
       MZE     COMR                                                     TDAC0111
       MZE     COMF                                                     TDAC0112
       MZE     SKRA                                                     TDAC0113
       MZE     SKRB                                                     TDAC0114
       MZE     SKFA                                                     TDAC0115
       MZE     SKFB                                                     TDAC0116
       MZE     BSAR                                                     TDAC0117
       MZE     BSBR                                                     TDAC0118
       MZE     BSAF                                                     TDAC0119
       MZE     BSBF                                                     TDAC0120
       PZE     WEFBX                                                    TDAC0121
       PZE     REWAX                                                    TDAC0122
       PZE     REWBX                                                    TDAC0123
       PZE     PAUSE                                                    TDAC0124
       PZE     BLANK                                                    TDAC0125
       SPACE   1                                                        TDAC0126
* DEFINE TAPE MODE (BINARY OR BCD)                                      TDAC0127
 MODE  LDI     B+2                  BIN OR   BCD                        TDAC0128
       RNT     223145                                                   TDAC0129
       TRA     *+3                                                      TDAC0130
       TSX     BIN,4                                                    TDAC0131
       TRA     RETURN                                                   TDAC0132
       SPACE   1                                                        TDAC0133
       TSX     BCD,4                                                    TDAC0134
       TRA     RETURN                                                   TDAC0135
       SPACE   1                                                        TDAC0136
 BIN   CAL     OCT20                                                    TDAC0137
       ORS     RTA                                                      TDAC0138
       ORS     RTB                                                      TDAC0139
       ORS     WTB                                                      TDAC0140
       TRA     1,4                                                      TDAC0141
       SPACE   1                                                        TDAC0142
 BCD   CAL     MSK1                                                     TDAC0143
       ANS     RTA                                                      TDAC0144
       ANS     RTB                                                      TDAC0145
       ANS     WTB                                                      TDAC0146
       TRA     1,4                                                      TDAC0147
       SPACE   2                                                        TDAC0148
* DEFINE CHANNEL A TAPE UNIT                                            TDAC0149
 ATAP  TSX     DEFA,4                                                   TDAC0150
       TRA     RETURN                                                   TDAC0151
       SPACE   1                                                        TDAC0152
 DEFA  AXT     4,1                                                      TDAC0153
       LDI     BSRA+4,1                                                 TDAC0154
       RIR     000017                                                   TDAC0155
       OAI                                                              TDAC0156
       STI     BSRA+4,1                                                 TDAC0157
       TIX     *-4,1,1                                                  TDAC0158
       TRA     1,4                                                      TDAC0159
       SPACE   2                                                        TDAC0160
* DEFINE CHANNEL B TAPE UNIT                                            TDAC0161
 BTAP  TSX     DEFB,4                                                   TDAC0162
       TRA     RETURN                                                   TDAC0163
       SPACE   1                                                        TDAC0164
 DEFB  AXT     6,1                                                      TDAC0165
       LDI     BSRB+6,1                                                 TDAC0166
       RIR     000017                                                   TDAC0167
       OAI                                                              TDAC0168
       STI     BSRB+6,1                                                 TDAC0169
       TIX     *-4,1,1                                                  TDAC0170
       TRA     1,4                                                      TDAC0171
       SPACE   2                                                        TDAC0172
* DUPLICATE N RECORDS                                                   TDAC0173
 DUPR  STZ     SWF                                                      TDAC0174
       TRA     DUP                                                      TDAC0175
       SPACE   2                                                        TDAC0176
* DUPLICATE N FILES                                                     TDAC0177
 DUPF  STL     SWF                                                      TDAC0178
       TRA     DUP                                                      TDAC0179
       SPACE   2                                                        TDAC0180
* COMPARE N RECORDS                                                     TDAC0181
 COMR  STZ     SWF                                                      TDAC0182
       TRA     COMP                                                     TDAC0183
       SPACE   2                                                        TDAC0184
* COMPARE N FILES                                                       TDAC0185
 COMF  STL     SWF                                                      TDAC0186
       TRA     COMP                                                     TDAC0187
       SPACE   2                                                        TDAC0188
* SKIP N RECORDS ON CHANNEL A TAPE                                      TDAC0189
 SKRA  XEC     RTA                                                      TDAC0190
       RCHA    CW2                                                      TDAC0191
       TSX     COUNT,4                                                  TDAC0192
       TRA     *-3                                                      TDAC0193
       SPACE   2                                                        TDAC0194
* SKIP N RECORDS ON CHANNEL B TAPE                                      TDAC0195
 SKRB  XEC     RTB                                                      TDAC0196
       RCHB    CW2                                                      TDAC0197
       TSX     COUNT,4                                                  TDAC0198
       TRA     *-3                                                      TDAC0199
       SPACE   2                                                        TDAC0200
* SKIP N FILES ON CHANNEL A TAPE                                        TDAC0201
 SKFA  XEC     RTA                                                      TDAC0202
       RCHA    CW3                                                      TDAC0203
       TSX     COUNT,4                                                  TDAC0204
       TRA     *-3                                                      TDAC0205
       SPACE   2                                                        TDAC0206
* SKIP N FILES ON CHANNEL B TAPE                                        TDAC0207
 SKFB  XEC     RTB                                                      TDAC0208
       RCHB    CW3                                                      TDAC0209
       TSX     COUNT,4                                                  TDAC0210
       TRA     *-3                                                      TDAC0211
       SPACE   2                                                        TDAC0212
* BACKSPACE CHANNEL A TAPE N RECORDS                                    TDAC0213
 BSAR  XEC     BSRA                                                     TDAC0214
       TSX     COUNT,4                                                  TDAC0215
       TRA     *-2                                                      TDAC0216
       SPACE   2                                                        TDAC0217
* BACKSPACE CHANNEL B TAPE N RECORDS                                    TDAC0218
 BSBR  XEC     BSRB                                                     TDAC0219
       TSX     COUNT,4                                                  TDAC0220
       TRA     *-2                                                      TDAC0221
       SPACE   2                                                        TDAC0222
* BACKSPACE CHANNEL A TAPE N FILES                                      TDAC0223
 BSAF  XEC     BSFA                                                     TDAC0224
       TSX     COUNT,4                                                  TDAC0225
       TRA     *-2                                                      TDAC0226
       SPACE   2                                                        TDAC0227
* BACKSPACE CHANNEL B TAPE N FILES                                      TDAC0228
 BSBF  XEC     BSFB                                                     TDAC0229
       TSX     COUNT,4                                                  TDAC0230
       TRA     *-2                                                      TDAC0231
       SPACE   2                                                        TDAC0232
* WRITE AN END OF FILE ON CHANNEL B TAPE                                TDAC0233
 WEFBX XEC     WEFB                                                     TDAC0234
       TRA     RETURN                                                   TDAC0235
       SPACE   2                                                        TDAC0236
* REWIND CHANNEL A TAPE                                                 TDAC0237
 REWAX XEC     REWA                                                     TDAC0238
       TRA     RETURN                                                   TDAC0239
       SPACE   2                                                        TDAC0240
* REWIND CHANNEL B TAPE                                                 TDAC0241
 REWBX XEC     REWB                                                     TDAC0242
       TRA     RETURN                                                   TDAC0243
       SPACE   2                                                        TDAC0244
* PAUSE CARD                                                            TDAC0245
 PAUSE HPR     511,7                                                    TDAC0246
       TRA     RETURN                                                   TDAC0247
       SPACE   2                                                        TDAC0248
* BLANK CONTROL CARD OR END OF FILE                                     TDAC0249
 BLANK STL     SW1                                                      TDAC0250
       TRA     RETURN                                                   TDAC0251
       SPACE   2                                                        TDAC0252
* RETURN ROUTINE                                                        TDAC0253
RETURN NZT     SW1                                                      TDAC0254
       TRA     START             READ NEXT CONTROL CARD.                TDAC0255
       HPR     511,7                                                    TDAC0256
       TSX     IOFF,4            TURN OFF INDICATORS.                   TDAC0257
       ENK                       BRING IN CONTROL WORD.                 TDAC0258
       PXA     0,0                                                      TDAC0259
       LGL     6                                                        TDAC0260
       TZE     *+2                                                      TDAC0261
       TSX     DEFA,4                                                   TDAC0262
       PXA     0,0                                                      TDAC0263
       LGL     6                                                        TDAC0264
       TZE     *+2                                                      TDAC0265
       TSX     DEFB,4                                                   TDAC0266
       PXA     0,0                                                      TDAC0267
       LGL     6                                                        TDAC0268
       PAC     0,2                                                      TDAC0269
       PXA     0,0                                                      TDAC0270
       LGL     3                                                        TDAC0271
       PAC     0,1                                                      TDAC0272
       XEC     TMOD,1                                                   TDAC0273
       PXA     0,0                                                      TDAC0274
       LGL     15                                                       TDAC0275
       STO     N                                                        TDAC0276
       TRA*    TTB2,2                                                   TDAC0277
       SPACE   1                                                        TDAC0278
 TMOD  NOP                                                              TDAC0279
       TSX     BCD,4                                                    TDAC0280
       TSX     BIN,4                                                    TDAC0281
       SPACE   2                                                        TDAC0282
 C00   STZ     SW1                                                      TDAC0283
       TRA     START                                                    TDAC0284
       SPACE   2                                                        TDAC0285
 TTB2  PZE     C00                                                      TDAC0286
       PZE     DUPR                                                     TDAC0287
       PZE     DUPF                                                     TDAC0288
       PZE     COMR                                                     TDAC0289
       PZE     COMF                                                     TDAC0290
       PZE     SKRA                                                     TDAC0291
       PZE     SKRB                                                     TDAC0292
       PZE     SKFA                                                     TDAC0293
       PZE     SKFB                                                     TDAC0294
       PZE     BSAR                                                     TDAC0295
       PZE     BSBR                                                     TDAC0296
       PZE     BSAF                                                     TDAC0297
       PZE     BSBF                                                     TDAC0298
       PZE     WEFBX                                                    TDAC0299
       PZE     REWAX                                                    TDAC0300
       PZE     REWBX                                                    TDAC0301
       SPACE   2                                                        TDAC0302
* PRINT ONE LINE WITH SPACING                                           TDAC0303
 PLINE SXA     PLEX,4                                                   TDAC0304
       CLA     1,4                                                      TDAC0305
       STO     *+5                                                      TDAC0306
       WPDA                                                             TDAC0307
       SPRA    4                                                        TDAC0308
       SPRA    3                                                        TDAC0309
       TSX     PRINT,4                                                  TDAC0310
       PZE     **                                                       TDAC0311
 PLEX  AXT     **,4                                                     TDAC0312
       TRA     2,4                                                      TDAC0313
       SPACE   2                                                        TDAC0314
* TURN OFF ALL TAPE INDICATORS                                          TDAC0315
 IOFF  TEFA    *+1                                                      TDAC0316
       TEFB    *+1                                                      TDAC0317
       TRCA    *+1                                                      TDAC0318
       TRCB    *+1                                                      TDAC0319
       TRA     1,4                                                      TDAC0320
       SPACE   2                                                        TDAC0321
* COUNT DOWN N AND BRANCH ON ZERO                                       TDAC0322
 COUNT CLA     N                                                        TDAC0323
       SUB     ONE                                                      TDAC0324
       TZE     RETURN                                                   TDAC0325
       STO     N                                                        TDAC0326
       TRA     1,4                                                      TDAC0327
       SPACE   2                                                        TDAC0328
* TAPE DUPLICATE ROUTINE                                                TDAC0329
 DUP   CLA     ONE                                                      TDAC0330
       STO     F                                                        TDAC0331
       STO     R                                                        TDAC0332
       SXD     CW6                                                      TDAC0333
 DP2   TSX     READA,4                                                  TDAC0334
       TCOB    *                                                        TDAC0335
       TRCB    DP5                                                      TDAC0336
       TRA     DP8                                                      TDAC0337
 DP5   XEC     BSRA                                                     TDAC0338
       XEC     BSRA                                                     TDAC0339
       TSX     READA,4                                                  TDAC0340
       TSX     REWRT,4                                                  TDAC0341
       TRA     DP2                                                      TDAC0342
 DP8   TEFA    *+2                                                      TDAC0343
       TRA     DP13                                                     TDAC0344
       XEC     WEFB                                                     TDAC0345
       TSX     COUNT,4                                                  TDAC0346
       CLA     ONE                                                      TDAC0347
       STO     R                                                        TDAC0348
       ADD     F                                                        TDAC0349
