* TAPE COMPARE SUBROUTINE                                               TDAC0430
 COMP  CLA     ONE                                                      TDAC0431
       STO     F                 FILE NUMBER                            TDAC0432
       STO     R                 RECORD NUMBER                          TDAC0433
       STZ     P                 PASS NUMBER                            TDAC0434
